(text "BK-KLINE-R1B — bench engineering prototype / NOT tested in vehicle" (at 30 249 0) (effects (font (size 1.17 1.17)) (justify left)) (uuid "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000008a"))
(text "Board scope: K-line PHY, TX gate and UART levels. AUTOMOTIVE 12V PROTECTION + DC/DC ARE EXTERNAL." (at 30 252.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.17 1.17)) (justify left)) (uuid "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000008b"))
(text "J1: switched protected ACC / chassis GND / parallel K-line tap (UAZ diagnostic pin 11, GND pin 12)." (at 30 256.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.17 1.17)) (justify left)) (uuid "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000008c"))
(text "J2: 12PIN Waveshare pigtail: 5V (2), GND (1), 3V3 (6), TXD43 (9), RXD44 (10), IO0 (12)." (at 30 260.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.17 1.17)) (justify left)) (uuid "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000008d"))
(text "J3 is regulated 5V input. NO direct 12V to LCD. Do not backfeed VBUS while also using USB." (at 30 263.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.17 1.17)) (justify left)) (uuid "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000008e"))
(text "TX_GATE_ENABLE: GPIO0 HIGH/Hi-Z turns OFF U2; GPIO0 LOW enables transmission. BOOT=LOW hazard." (at 30 267.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.17 1.17)) (justify left)) (uuid "00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000008f"))
(text "JP1 must be OPEN for flashing, boot-button use and initial bench tests; never break OEM K-line." (at 30 271.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.17 1.17)) (justify left)) (uuid "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000090"))
(text "U1.LO pin2 and U1.LI pin8 are NC. C1/C2 next to U1, C3 next to U2. Check 3V3 headroom." (at 30 274.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.17 1.17)) (justify left)) (uuid "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000091"))
(text "Pinheader footprints are DEMO placeholders: choose locked connectors before PCB production." (at 30 278.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.17 1.17)) (justify left)) (uuid "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000092"))
(text "Datasheet review ≠ completed ERC, DRC, tests or approved production circuit." (at 30 282.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.17 1.17)) (justify left)) (uuid "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000093"))
